- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/llm/provenance.rs` — `LlmProvenance` struct, SHA-256 hashing, attachment to proposals.
- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/llm/budget.rs` — `LlmBudget`, `BudgetOutcome`, `BudgetCatalog`, fallback dispatch.
- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/llm/provenance_tests.rs` — provenance reproducibility, budget overruns, per-kind queue drops, failure-event emission.
- `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-consolidation-llm-budgets.md` — per-job-type cost and latency budgets, queue bounds, failure handling, provenance record format, operator overrides, spec citation.

