docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T42.md:12:This task implements the four LLM-driven consolidation jobs the spec calls out as inherently non-deterministic: episode-summary generation (richer than T40's deterministic template), procedure extraction from repeated successful workflows, contradiction detection across memories, and failure-pattern extraction from repeated diagnostics. The spec is explicit that these jobs MUST run only in background or manual-review modes, NEVER on the synchronous post-task hot path, and MUST emit proposals (never silent writes). This task ships the four job implementations and the LLM-driver abstraction; T43 layers provenance and budgets on top, T44 adds the manual-review queue for high-scope outputs, T45 makes the work replay-safe.
