+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/llm/provenance_tests.rs` — added provenance, reproducibility, budget-overrun, queue-overflow, and architecture-doc tests.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/llm/{mod.rs,episode.rs,procedure.rs,contradiction.rs,failure_pattern.rs}` — wired per-kind budgets, provenance recording, and proposal attachment into all four LLM jobs.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/{proposal.rs,queue.rs,schema.sql,mod.rs}` — added proposal `provenance_json` persistence, migration handling, LLM queue slice drops, and queue-full `ConsolidationFailed` emission.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/{review_queue.rs,replay.rs}` — narrow compile/format integration fixes needed by the current consolidation module graph.
+- `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-consolidation-llm-budgets.md` — documented budgets, bounded queue behavior, failure handling, provenance fields, operator overrides, and spec citation.
