+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/consolidation/{proposal.rs,queue.rs,schema.sql,mod.rs}` — added proposal `provenance_json` persistence, migration handling, LLM queue slice drops, and queue-full `ConsolidationFailed` emission.
